  "finalText": "### Changes Implemented\n\n1. **CSV EOF Record Termination (`src/csv.mjs`)**:\n   - In `parseCsv`, committed any in-progress record at end-of-file (`if (recordStarted) endRecord();`). Because `recordStarted` is set when encountering quotes, delimiters, or plain characters and cleared on `endRecord()`, this captures final records lacking a trailing newline (including quoted fields and trailing empty fields) without creating phantom records after a trailing newline.\n\n2. **Exact Half-Away-From-Zero Cent Rounding (`src/money.mjs`)**:\n   - In `parseMoney`, replaced binary floating-point multiplication (`Math.round(Number(text) * 100)`) with exact decimal `BigInt` parsing scaled to $10^{-4}$ major units (`(scaled + 50n) / 100n`), applying the sign symmetrically so both positive and negative half-cent amounts round away from zero while preserving format and safe-integer validation.\n\n3. **Vendor-Scoped Collision-Safe Invoice Identity (`src/dedupe.mjs`)**:\n   - Updated `invoiceKey` from `invoice.invoiceId` to `JSON.stringify([invoice.vendorId, invoice.invoiceId])` (matching `paymentKey`), ensuring invoice deduplication, conflict detection, and payment indexing/routing are scoped to each supplier without delimiter collisions.\n\n### Commands Run & Results\n\n1. `node --test test/*.test.mjs` (before changes):\n   - **Result**: 38 passed, 6 failed (failures in `cli.test.mjs`, `csv.test.mjs`, `domain.test.mjs`, `money.test.mjs`, and `pipeline.test.mjs`).\n2. `node --test test/*.test.mjs` (after changes):\n   - **Result**: All 44 tests passed, 0 failed.\n3. `node bin/ledger.mjs import data/invoices.csv --payments data/payments.csv --as-of 2026-03-01 --format json`:\n   - **Result**: Exited with status `0`. Imported all 4 source rows across 3 vendors (`vendor-a`, `vendor-b`, `vendor-c`) with 0 conflicts or diagnostics, rounded amounts to `1.01`, `10.08`, `-1.01`, and `2.00` (`totalCents: 1208`, `creditCents: -101`), and applied all 3 payments (`paidCents: 750`, `outstandingCents: 458`, `aging: 559` in `1-30`).",
